EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
       sswwaappooffff has the following exit status values since v2.36:

       00
           success

       22
           system has insufficient memory to stop swapping (OOM)

       44
           sswwaappooffff(2) syscall failed for another reason

       88
           non-sswwaappooffff(2) syscall system error (out of memory, ...)

       1166
           usage or syntax error

       3322
           all swapoff failed on ----aallll

       6644
           some swapoff succeeded on ----aallll

       The command sswwaappooffff ----aallll returns 0 (all succeeded), 32 (all failed),
       or 64 (some failed, some succeeded).

       + The old versions before v2.36 has no documented exit status, 0 means
       success in all versions.

